# $capability_id Output Artifact Manifest Contract

## Purpose

Describe expected scaffold artifacts without creating runtime authority.

## Expected Output File Names

$output_file_names

## Required Manifest Fields

- `manifest_id`
- `capability_id`
- `metadata_only`
- `artifact_count`
- `artifacts`
- `validation`
- `forbidden_boundaries_preserved`

## Manifest Rules

- Every artifact entry must have a relative path, purpose, and contract status.
- Manifest text must not include credential material or cookie material.
- Manifest text must not claim production readiness.
- Manifest text must not describe live website automation support.
